  "description": {
    "en": "Plugin market index for dsh-hindsight-memory, the DeepSeek Harness plugin that shares one Hindsight memory bank with omp (oh-my-pi) using identical tag semantics. Add the raw URL of this file under Plugins > Discover > Index sources.",
    "zh": "dsh-hindsight-memory 的插件市场索引。DSH 的「插件 → 发现 → 索引源」里填入本文件的 raw URL 即可看到本插件。本插件让 DSH 与 omp 共用同一个 Hindsight 记忆库，并用同一套标签语义做全局层/项目层分层。"
  },
